{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2021-04-30 09:02:00', 'title': 'CUSHING® ASSET MANAGEMENT AND SWANK CAPITAL ANNOUNCE A CONSTITUENT CHANGE TO THE CUSHING® MLP HIGH INCOME INDEX', 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CUSHING® ASSET MANAGEMENT,\xa0LP, AND SWANK CAPITAL,\xa0LLC, ANNOUNCE AN UPCOMING INTERIM CHANGE TO THE CONSTITUENTS OF THE CUSHING ® MLP HIGH INCOME INDEX (THE "INDEX"). ON FEBRUARY 16, 2021, INDEX CONSTITUENTS ENABLE MIDSTREAM PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: ENBL) AND ENERGY TRANSFER LP (NYSE: ET) ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT AND PLAN OF MERGER THAT, IF APPROVED BY AT LEAST A MAJORITY OF ENBL COMMON UNITHOLDERS, WOULD RESULT IN ENBL COMMON UNITS CEASING TO BE PUBLICLY TRADED.'}